&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;137&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e157472a5785&quot;&gt;Our platform powers the commercial foundation of Nebius Cloud. Every GPU hour, storage operation, network transfer, reservation, enterprise contract, or customer payment flows through the systems we build before becoming revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
