&lt;li&gt;Exposure to the whole software development lifecycle from inception to production and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Advertising Attribution domain is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in agile software development processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
