&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Head of Design Systems&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Brand and Design&lt;/strong&gt; team at Doctolib.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to ensure every Doctolib product surface is built on a consistent, high-quality design foundation. You will own &lt;strong&gt;Oxygen&lt;/strong&gt;, Doctolib&#39;s design system - much more than a component library. Oxygen is how we deliver our brand identity consistently throughout the product and the critical infrastructure that ensures design quality at scale across an AI-first development environment. With over 50 designers and engineers building across multiple markets and product surfaces, your work will directly shape the experience of more than 90 million patients and 400,000 healthcare professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
