&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish cross-functional governance&lt;/strong&gt; across Design, Product, Engineering, and Brand teams, defining contribution models, change management processes, and the standards other teams are expected to follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own design output quality across the product,&lt;/strong&gt; ensuring that AI-generated interfaces are coherent, consistent, and on-brand at every touchpoint across the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and drive cross-organizational adoption,&lt;/strong&gt; measuring adoption rate, component coverage, and contribution velocity, and connecting those metrics to product team speed and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and grow a team of designers, product people and engineers,&lt;/strong&gt; setting career paths, a high bar for craft, and hiring for the roles the system needs next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
